## Summary of Changes

### What Gets REMOVED (out of scope per spec)
| Current Feature | Reason for Removal |
|---|---|
| `AdminDashboard.jsx` | No "Admin" role in spec — only Coordinator and Donors |
| `VolunteerHub.jsx` | Volunteers explicitly excluded from scope |
| `FinancialLedger.jsx` | Cash donations out of scope — goods only |
| `MapView.jsx` | No map/geo features in spec |
| `SmartMatch.jsx` | Replaced by the Live Needs Board with pledge system |
| `Appeal.jsx` | No admin approval flow — single barangay account model |
| `PendingVerification.jsx` | No admin verification — barangay registers directly |
| `Feedback.jsx` | Not in spec |
| SMS/USSD Gateway (in Coordinator) | Out of scope |
| Multi-center management | Single barangay scope |
| Inventory/Storage Analytics | Not in spec |
| Cross-center transfers | Single barangay scope |

### What Gets ADDED (new spec features)
| New Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **24-Hour Reservation Timer** | Pledges auto-expire after 24h, returning quantity to active pool |
| **QR Verification Code** | Generated after pledge for fast scanning at drop-off |
| **Manual Verification Code** | `DMY-XXXX` code alternative for non-tech users |
| **Strike System** | 1 miss = warning, 2 = temp block, 3 = account restricted |
| **Partial Verification** | Coordinator can confirm Full/Partial/Reject delivery |
| **Fallback Verification** | Search by phone/name if QR/code is lost |
| **First-Commit Locking** | Real-time quantity lock prevents duplicate pledges |
| **Urgency Boost** | Critical items highlighted, pulsing, pinned to top |
| **Anonymous Donation Mode** | Public anonymity, coordinator still sees details |
| **Community vs External Donors** | Permanent vs temporary accounts |
| **Barangay QR Registration** | Coordinator generates QR for donor onboarding |
| **Donation History Logs** | Full audit trail per donor |
| **Need Status Tracker** | Active/fulfilled/expired tracking |

