## Proposed Changes

### 1. Data Store — Complete Rewrite

#### [MODIFY] [store.js](file:///c:/Users/ranie/.gemini/antigravity-ide/scratch/damayan-app/src/store.js)

**Full rewrite** of the Zustand store to match the new data model:

**New Data Schema:**
```js
// Barangay (single instance)
barangay: {
  id, name, email, password, coordinatorName, position,
  registrationQR: string, // generated barangay QR code data
  deviceId: string,
}

// Users (only donors now — coordinator is the barangay itself)
users: [{ 
  id, name, phone, address?, password?, 
  type: 'community' | 'external',
  isAnonymous: boolean,
  strikes: 0, // 0-3
  status: 'active' | 'suspended' | 'blocked',
  createdAt, barangayId,
}]

// Needs (posted by coordinator)
needs: [{
  id, itemName, category, quantityNeeded, quantityPledged, quantityDelivered,
  urgency: 'critical' | 'moderate' | 'stable',
  dropOffPoint: string,
  status: 'active' | 'fulfilled' | 'closed',
  createdAt,
}]

// Pledges (the reservation system)
pledges: [{
  id, needId, donorId, quantity, 
  verificationCode: string, // DMY-XXXX
  qrData: string,
  status: 'reserved' | 'verified_full' | 'verified_partial' | 'expired' | 'rejected',
  actualDelivered: number | null,
  createdAt,
  expiresAt, // createdAt + 24h
}]

// Donation History (verified deliveries)
donationHistory: [{
  id, pledgeId, donorId, needId, 
  itemName, quantity, verifiedAt,
  verifiedBy: 'qr' | 'manual' | 'fallback',
}]
```

**New Store Actions:**
- `loginAsCoordinator(email, password)` — single barangay login
- `registerDonor(donorData, type)` — community or external registration
- `loginAsDonor(phone, password)` — donor login
- `postNeed({ itemName, category, quantity, urgency, dropOffPoint })`
- `updateNeed(needId, updates)` — coordinator edits
- `closeNeed(needId)` — mark request completed
- `createPledge(needId, donorId, quantity)` — with first-commit locking, generates QR + manual code
- `verifyPledge(pledgeId, type, actualQuantity)` — full/partial/reject verification
- `verifyByFallback(searchTerm)` — search by phone/name
- `expirePledges()` — auto-expiration logic (runs on interval)
- `addStrike(donorId)` — increment strike counter
- `generateBarangayQR()` — generate registration QR
- `toggleAnonymous(donorId)` — toggle anonymous mode

